1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Job search fatigue is repeated searching, manual comparison, and uncertainty about which application deserves the next hour.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:35,000
JobPilot brings synthetic roles from the processed official-source portfolio into one profile-configured nearby view without device location or a map service.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Best Match, Nearest, Most Recent, and Evidence Quality are deterministic visible sorts. Distance never changes technical Fit Score.

4
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:22,000
The role view separates matches, gaps, required and preferred evidence, and month-level relevant experience. Every point traces to frozen evidence IDs.

5
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:38,000
The independent verifier reproduces hashing and exact score mathematics. Tampering fails safely with zero external requests.

6
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Compare up to three roles with visible factors and no hidden aggregate score. Prepared GPT-5.6 review adds advice, not points.

7
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:06,000
The safe employer destination opens in a new tab, contains no form, and intentionally disables application submission.

8
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Only an explicit user action moves a role to Preparing. Returning never marks it Applied.

9
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Prepared GPT-5.6 strategy and critique use frozen synthetic evidence with zero OpenAI API calls and zero API cost. Gemma remains primary.

10
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:55,000
The optional seven-step tour proves discovery, evidence, verification, employer control, and tracking—so candidates find the roles worth their time.
